  "evidences": [
    {
      "id": "ev_1",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Lookout_ViperRAT-IDF(02-16-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s1"
      },
      "text": "ViperRAT is an active, advanced persistent threat (APT) that sophisticated threat actors are actively using to target and spy on the Israeli Defense Force.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_2",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Lookout_ViperRAT-IDF(02-16-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s2"
      },
      "text": "The threat actors behind the ViperRAT surveillanceware collect a significant amount of sensitive information off of the device, and seem most interested in exfiltrating images and audio content.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_4",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Lookout_ViperRAT-IDF(02-16-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s4"
      },
      "text": "Lookout has determined ViperRAT is a very sophisticated threat that adds to the mounting evidence that targeted mobile attacks against governments and business is a real problem.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_10",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Lookout_ViperRAT-IDF(02-16-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s5"
      },
      "text": "We also uncovered ViperRAT in a billiards game, an Israeli Love Songs player, and a Move To iOS app.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_12",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Lookout_ViperRAT-IDF(02-16-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s2"
      },
      "text": "ViperRAT takes this one step further by using its dropper app to identify an appropriate second stage ‘update’ that may go unnoticed.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_21",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Lookout_ViperRAT-IDF(02-16-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 6,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p6_s1"
      },
      "text": "On attribution Media reporting on ViperRAT thus far attributes this surveillanceware tool to Hamas.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_24",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Lookout_ViperRAT-IDF(02-16-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 7,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p7_s3"
      },
      "text": "Hamas is not widely known for having a sophisticated mobile capability, which makes it unlikely they are directly responsible for ViperRAT.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_27",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Lookout_ViperRAT-IDF(02-16-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 7,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p7_s6"
      },
      "text": "However, the existence of threats like ViperRAT and Pegasus, the most sophisticated piece of mobile surveillanceware we’ve seen to date , are evidence that attackers are targeting mobile devices.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
